ter product uptake","Smoother skin, fuller brows"],"effect":"indirect","text":"Forum users stamp skin, under-eye lines and brows, sometimes alongside minoxidil, for smoother skin and fuller brows. Short needles create tiny punctures that prompt repair and help products absorb. Microneedling generally has studies; none were found for the stamp itself."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["A dermastamp is a handheld microneedling tool that presses a pad of short needles into the skin in a stamping motion, as opposed to the rolling action of a dermaroller. It is discussed on looksmax.org for use on skin, brows, under-eye lines and as a way to help topicals penetrate.[1][2][3][4]","Laboratory research on related oscillating microneedle devices has looked at improving delivery of drugs such as imiquimod through the skin in basal cell carcinoma.[5][6] No published trials of dermastamps for appearance outcomes were found in the sources reviewed."],"infobox":[["Type","Handheld microneedle stamp"],["Related","Dermaroller, Dermapen, SkinPen"],["Looksmaxxing uses","Skin texture, brows, lines, topical delivery"]],"sections":[{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. Research on a related oscillating microneedle pen (Dermapen) as a delivery method for imiquimod in nodular basal cell carcinoma has been published, as has a doctoral thesis on the topic, but these concern cancer treatment rather than cosmetic stamps.[5][6]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Use in looksmaxxing","paras":["Looksmax.org threads include a user asking how often to stamp brows alongside minoxidil,[1] threads comparing a dermaroller with a dermastamp,[3] a thread asking whether a stamp can replicate a \"microinfusion\" treatment,[7] and a post that claims a stamping method removes laugh lines and eye lines.[4]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Looksmax.org posters discuss dermastamps for brows, skin and lines, mostly as an inexpensive alternative to clinic microneedling.[1][3][4]","claims":[{"claim":"A dermastamp can reduce laugh lines and eye lines","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Stamping the brows alongside minoxidil can support brow growth","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"A stamp can replace clinic microinfusion treatments","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermastamp.920027/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.1275680/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.760648/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"here is how a dermastamp gets rid of laugh lines eye lines","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/here-is-how-a-dermastamp-gets-rid-of-laugh-lines-eye-lines-bookmark-even-if-you-dont-have-them-yet-my-method.584787/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Intradermal Delivery of an Immunomodulator for Basal Cell Carcinoma; solid microneedle-enhanced delivery","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32510228/","source":"Molecular Pharmaceutics","year":2020,"type":"study"},{"title":"Application of microneedles for the treatment of nodular basal cell carcinoma","url":"https://europepmc.org/article/ETH/836401","source":"University of Nottingham thesis","year":2021,"type":"study"},{"title":"could u use a dermastamp like the cure microinfusion","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/could-u-use-a-dermastamp-like-the-cure-microinfusion.928759/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Microneedling (Collagen induction therapy)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microneedling","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Intradermal Delivery of an Immunomodulator for Basal Cell Carcinoma; solid microneedle-enhanced delivery","url":"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.n